Description:It is your second main phase. You control Monastery Swiftspear and have Shock and Fling in hand, with three red mana floating. The opponent is at 4 life and controls a tapped Silent Arbiter. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-sacrifice-cost-no-prowess | Fling's sacrifice is a cost paid before Fling becomes cast (CR 601.2h-i), so the sacrificed Swiftspear is gone when the prowess trigger would trigger, and Fling uses its power as it last existed (CR 608.2h): Shock the opponent first (prowess makes Swiftspear 2/3), then Fling it for 2; Fling first deals only 1, then Shock 2, leaving the opponent at 1
